  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_be132657-5c67-4e47-972a-5307c09d83fb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"48\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_868db16e-2d0e-41cc-a1ba-6e9f7ef12185.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"241\" height=\"48\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fimproved-sodiumembeddium-rus-translation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_52418866-77d4-4ac9-9046-a4a39a739ae8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"236\" height=\"47\"></a></p><hr><p><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">EN</span> 改善 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">S</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">odium<span style=\"color:#fff\"> | </span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Embeddium</span></span> 的俄文翻譯，包含部分附加元件</strong>：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamiclights-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>動態光源</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chloride\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>氯化物 (Sodium/Emeddium++)</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xenon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>氙氣 (Embeddium 分支)</strong></a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_e4e591f3-64cd-4263-9a55-8821843f862d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"69\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1344774/description_643fcbe8-ecf9-4b69-8d23-a9b98ded3452.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"327\" height=\"69\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">РУ</span> 改善 <span